  "name": "WAInjectBench: Benchmarking Prompt Injection Detections for Web Agents",
  "notes": "The annotation and scope were reviewed against the complete retained original arXiv abstract. Experimental findings and artifact availability have not been independently reproduced. The reported contribution evaluates attack detection; end-to-end prevention of browser-agent compromise is not inferred.",
  "published_at": "2025-10-01",
